  "description": "FunkyORM, a lightweight micro-ORM designed for simplicity and speed. Enables intuitive lambda-style queries and leverages conventions alongside annotations for seamless mappings. Features minimal setup, a gentle learning curve, and blazing-fast runtime performance. Includes SQL Server, PostgreSQL, and SQLite providers. Supports .NET 8, .NET Standard 2.0, and .NET Framework 4.8.",
